==History==
2016
*The Goblins [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016{{Balance|Add}}.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Goblins' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles){{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12){{Balance|Buff}}. The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Goblins' range to 0.5 tiles (from 1 tile), but their effective range was unchanged{{Balance|Neutral}}.
2017
* On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased the Goblins' damage by 6%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
2018 
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblins' hitpoints by 1%{{Balance|Nerf}}. This was to fix an inconsistency with [[Minions]] that could not take out Goblins in two hits at the same Level.
2019 
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Goblins' card info screen{{Balance|Add}}.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], gave the Goblins a new 0.1 second deploy stagger from each other{{Balance|Add}}.
2021
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021 Quarter 3 Update (6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the distance between the Goblins upon deployment{{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13){{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the unit count to 4 (from 3){{Balance|Buff}}, and increased their first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.2 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}}. It also changed the description of the card. It used to read "''Three fast, unarmored melee attackers. Small, fast, green and mean!''"{{Balance|Neutral}}.
2023 
*On 6/6/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(6/6/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the deploy stagger for each Goblin to 0.2 seconds (from 0.1 seconds){{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14){{Balance|Buff}}.
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblins' deployment time to 1.2 seconds (from 1 second){{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin%20World%20Update%20(17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], added the Goblins to the Goblin class{{Balance|Neutral}}.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Goblins' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the [[Arenas|Arena]] they were placed{{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 9/4/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblins' first attack time interval to 0.6 seconds (from 0.4 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}}, but also decreased their deployment time to 1 second (from 1.2 seconds){{Balance|Buff}}.
* On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 16 (from 15){{Balance|Buff}}.
2026
* On 2/2/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/2/2026)|febuary 2026 update]] added the Goblins [[Heroes|Hero]] form{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblins' damage by 4%{{Balance|Buff}}.

